1
00:00:00,906 --> 00:00:02,536
(Alicia:)They're happy, I get stuff.

2
00:00:02,741 --> 00:00:05,661
Who cares? And how is it
any different from what you do?

3
00:00:08,288 --> 00:00:10,248
(Penny:)Excuse me?

4
00:00:10,457 --> 00:00:11,837
(Alicia:)I've seen you around them.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,170
(Alicia:)Are you pretending
like you don't do the exact same thing?

6
00:00:15,337 --> 00:00:19,507
(Penny:)Okay, lady, you are way out of line.

7
00:00:19,966 --> 00:00:23,556
- Oh, I'm out of line?
- Yeah, you're out of line.

8
00:00:23,762 --> 00:00:27,812
Well, what are you gonna do about it,
bitch?

9
00:00:31,269 --> 00:00:32,689
(Raj:)I like Green Lantern.

10
00:00:32,854 --> 00:00:37,024
(Raj:)I'm just saying it's pretty lame
that he can be defeated by the color yellow.

11
00:00:37,192 --> 00:00:40,482
(Sheldon:)Only the modern Green Lantern
is vulnerable to yellow.

12
00:00:40,695 --> 00:00:42,865
Golden-age Green Lantern
was vulnerable to wood.

13
00:00:43,073 --> 00:00:46,323
(Raj:)Great, so I can take them both out
with a number-two pencil?

14
00:00:46,493 --> 00:00:48,493
[PENNY AND ALICIA SCREAMING]

15
00:00:51,748 --> 00:00:55,708
Oh, my God. Girl fight!

16
00:00:56,211 --> 00:00:57,211
(Leonard:)What are you doing?

17
00:00:57,420 --> 00:01:11,030
(Howard:)I know you.
You're stupid enough to break it up.

